      ],
      "text": "C-TST: all five studies were conducted in China and included only HIV-negative adults. All",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9093017578125,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "of them included non-random allocation of C-TST versus the TST into two arms; thus, no",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9633178710938,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "study evaluating C-TST was included in the pooled evidence assessment on any ISR. Also,",
