      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.16119384765625,
        526.9093627929688,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "adolescents – healthy, contacts of TB patients and with TB). Two studies on Diaskintest",
