      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.3599243164062,
        527.0140991210938,
        635.5049438476562
      ],
      "text": "0.60–1.10). The Diaskintest study was considered to have high risk of bias, while the overall",
